BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike Repair 101
DTSTART:20260828T200000Z
DTEND:20260828T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260817T060318Z
UID:8abf1eba-d7ab-5e25-8a19-22bede5fca2a
DESCRIPTION:Join our Basic Bike Maintenance Workshop at the Cycle Toronto 
 Rec Hub to learn hands-on skills including bike fit\, safety checks\, and 
 drive train care. This session provides access to all recommended tools an
 d staff guidance to help you keep your bike safe and road-ready. You'll le
 ave knowing how to perform routine maintenance yourself and clearly unders
 tand the basics of fixing your bike.\n\nDoors: 4 PM\n\nSession: 4:00-6:00 
 PM\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260828
LOCATION:Evergreen Brickworks\n550 Bayview ave\n10\nToronto ON M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260828
END:VEVENT
